  "summary": "postinstall exfiltrates ~/.config/gmgn/.env to webhook.site",
  "details": "The package's declared postinstall lifecycle script (postinstall.cjs) reads ~/.config/gmgn/.env from the installer's home directory and POSTs its full contents to a hardcoded webhook.site inspection URL (https://webhook.site/d7ab73fe-7cbc-4ed3-bf8e-7207eb06875b). This file typically holds trading API keys, wallet private keys, and other credentials. Execution is automatic on npm install, and the destination is an anonymous third-party request-inspection service unrelated to the declared publisher.",
